  "history": "Index Ventures was founded in Geneva in 1996 by Neil Rimer, David Rimer and Giuseppe Zocco, out of a family bond trading firm. It became known for early bets on Skype, MySQL, Dropbox, Adyen, Figma, Revolut and Wiz, and opened offices in London in 2002, San Francisco in 2011 and New York in 2022. In July 2026 it announced new seed, venture and growth funds that bring its investing capital to $3.5 billion.",
